# Module 02 sealed-tier targets. See modules/01-cors-session-hijack/lab.env for the rationale.
#
# LAB_REBIND_HOST is the attacker's own domain, the one whose DNS answer flips to the victim. In the
# sealed tier nothing resolves it: the scenario only needs the literal string, because the whole point
# is the Host header the victim sees. The live flip is the split-host tier (see ./README.md).

# For the streamable-http transport MCP_TARGET_URL is the full endpoint, not just the base.
MCP_TARGET_URL=http://mcp.lab.consulereit.nl:8080/mcp
LAB_REBIND_HOST=rebind.lab.consulereit.nl
LAB_COLLECTOR_URL=http://collector.lab.consulereit.nl:9000/pwned
LAB_CANARY_PREFIX=LAB_CANARY
